## SQ-SHB-05 | Balloon under open sky; courier under a roof (SHB-09, SHB-10)
@group A
@commands Bin with 32 wheat under open sky: a balloon; bin with 32 wheat under a stone roof at y -58: a crate on the bin and a courier within 20 blocks; after 60 s neither is left
@pass `shipping_balloon` 1 at the first bin; `shipping_crate` and `courier` at the second; both gone after the walk (or the timer: 60 s plus the drink)
@fails No carrier; the courier stays (path or timer); a second courier for the same bin
@absent farmingforblockheads:shipping_bin farmingforblockheads:courier_spawn farmingforblockheads:shipping_balloon farmingforblockheads:shipping_crate farmingforblockheads:courier (registered 2026-11-25, after the last /dumpall)
> setblock 612 -60 600 farmingforblockheads:shipping_bin[facing=north]{Items:[{Slot:0b,id:"minecraft:wheat",Count:32b}]}
sleep 2
> execute if entity @e[type=farmingforblockheads:shipping_balloon,x=612,y=-60,z=600,distance=..6]
expect Test passed
> fill 614 -58 598 618 -58 602 minecraft:stone
> setblock 616 -60 600 farmingforblockheads:shipping_bin[facing=north]{Items:[{Slot:0b,id:"minecraft:wheat",Count:32b}]}
sleep 2
> execute if entity @e[type=farmingforblockheads:shipping_crate,x=616,y=-59,z=600,distance=..2]
expect Test passed
