## SQ-SHB-06 | Courier modes, walk distance, spawn point, no path, timeout (SHB-13 to SHB-18, SHB-27)
@group A
@commands `courierMode` walk_out and at_bin; `courierWalkDistance` 4 and 20; a Courier Spawn Point 10, 90 and 100 blocks off; a bin walled in; a maze with `courierWalkTimeoutTicks` 200
@pass As SHB-13 to SHB-18 and SHB-27 in the writeup: the courier appears beside the bin and walks off / drinks there; its start moves with the distance; it starts on a spawn point in range (not at 100) and walks back to it; walled in: it appears beside the bin; maze: Enderman teleport to the bin after 10 s
@fails Courier stuck; path to a spawn point out of range; the timer not applied on the way out
@draft config edits between sales (qrun.py toml + /reload of the COMMON config is not live: courier values are read per sale, so a toml edit on disk needs a restart or the config watcher); positions for the maze and the walls
> say draft

